    - Name: <Text>k__BackingField
      Entry: 1
      Data: Fine. I need 5 <style=item>stones</style> for eyes and buttons, 2 pieces
        of <style=item>wood</style> to make the arms, and a <style=item>carrot</style>
        for his nose. Then he'll look good!
